    "notes": "Windows/Linux59 exposes installed Outlook rolling24h shared device/account cap and remaining usage. Exact approvals/send keys/pacing/admission remain unchanged; per-mailbox and reply exemptions are assessed but not implemented. Owner-only cap changes require coordinated backend support. Windows source03e; Linux42bc changes only bounded apt lock waits with equivalent runtime. Windows unsigned; Mac50/39 retained. No customer installation, live send or cap mutation is claimed.",
